<title>USA: Central Vermont Public Q3 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Central Vermont Public Q3 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>RUTLAND, Vt. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.11   profit	 $0.11</p>
<p> Net loss		     785   profit	 1,748</p>
<p> Revs			63,833		   60,314</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,520		   11,619</p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.04   profit	 $1.11</p>
<p> Net profit		13,526   profit	14,481</p>
<p> Revs		     209,469		  210,023</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  11,552		   11,669</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - First nine months of 1996 figures reflect an after-tax gain of $1.14 million, or $0.10 per share, from insurance proceeds.</p>
<p>1995 Q3 and first nine months reflect an after-tax gain of $905,000, or $0.08 per share, from the sale of its interest in Appomattox.</p>
<p>Full company name is Central Vermont Public Service Corp</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
